sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin / Platform Operator
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Op as mlflow-operator<br/>SA: mlflow-operator-controller-manager
    participant Client as Client / SDK / Dashboard
    participant GW as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as mlflow Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS (service-ca)
    participant DB as Metadata DB<br/>5432/3306 TCP
    participant Obj as Object Storage / PVC<br/>443/9000 TCP
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(monitoring ns)

    Note over Admin,Op: Flow 1 - MLflow CR reconciliation
    Admin->>API: Create MLflow CR (CEL validated)<br/>TLS 1.2+, User/SA token
    Op->>API: Watch MLflow, MLflowOperator, owned resources<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Op->>API: Server-side apply rendered chart objects,<br/>HTTPRoute, ConsoleLink
    Op->>API: On version change: scale to zero,<br/>create migration Job

    Note over Client,Obj: Flow 2 - User request to MLflow
    Client->>GW: HTTPS /mlflow<br/>Bearer token
    GW->>MLflow: HTTPS 8443 (TLS re-encrypt)<br/>Bearer token forwarded
    MLflow->>API: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>Caller token
    API-->>MLflow: allowed / denied
    MLflow->>DB: SQL query<br/>DB credentials (TLS per URI)
    MLflow->>Obj: Read/write artifacts<br/>Storage credentials
    Obj-->>MLflow: Artifacts
    MLflow-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: Response

    Note over Prom,Op: Flow 3 - Operator metrics scrape
    Prom->>Op: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer (TokenReview + SAR)
    Op-->>Prom: Metrics

    Note over Op,API: Flow 4 - Namespace group RBAC
    Op->>API: Watch labeled Namespaces, read Auth CR<br/>SA token
    Op->>API: Create/update odh-group-mlflow-view/edit<br/>RoleBindings
